# Chandam Project - Cline/Roo Code Rules

## Project
Chandam (ఛందం) = Telugu/Sanskrit/Kannada poetry meter analysis system.
379 Telugu rules, 554 tested examples, 96.09% accuracy.

## Critical: Read-Only Projects

NEVER modify these — they contain undocumented domain knowledge:
- Chandam.Core/ — matching engine, scoring
- Chandam.Rules/ — 343+ rule data classes
- Chandam.Util/ — contracts, enums, Manager
- Chandam.Indic/ — Indic script processing
- Chandam.Samples/ — sample poems

## Critical: Telugu Authenticity
- Never force English translations of Telugu domain terms
- Maintain Unicode support everywhere
- Test with actual Telugu text

## Architecture

Core (READ-ONLY):
  Chandam.Util       <- no deps
  Chandam.Indic      <- Util
  Chandam.Core       <- Util, Indic (NO Rules/Samples)

API:
  Chandam.API        <- Core, Util, Indic (service wrapper)
  Chandam.API.WebApi <- REST API (8 endpoints)

MCP:
  Chandam.MCP.Tools  <- 7 tool definitions
  Chandam.MCP.Stdio  <- stdio transport (Claude Desktop)
  Chandam.MCP.Http   <- HTTP/SSE transport

Web:
  Chandam.Wasm       <- Blazor WebAssembly

Rules loaded at runtime via JSON/YAML config — not compiled in.

## Tech: C# / .NET 8.0, Blazor WASM, xUnit, Docker, YamlDotNet

## Build & Test
```bash
dotnet build Chandam.sln
dotnet test Chandam.MCP.Tests
dotnet test Chandam.API.IntegrationTests
dotnet publish Chandam.Wasm -c Release -p:ExcludeYaml=true
```

## Coding Standards
- KISS — no future-proofing
- N-Layer: Interface -> Service -> Data Access + Contracts
- Small functions, mandatory parameters
- Constants folder; secrets in .env
- Commit: [Phase#] Category: Description

## File Placement
- Docs: Docs/plans/ and Docs/execution/
- Scripts: Docs/Scripts/
- Rules: Chandam.Config/Rules/ (YAML preferred for Telugu)
- Baselines: Chandam.Config/Baselines/

## Gotchas
- ExcludeYaml=true must be CLI -p: flag (not csproj) for global propagation
- HybridGlobalization in WASM saves ~400KB ICU data
- Language codes: ISO 639-1 (te), ISO 639-2 (tel), numeric (0), names (Telugu)
